"parent_id\":\"section-1\",\"start_char\":48,\"title\":\"优惠码\"}],\"old_ranges\":[{\"end_char\":83,\"end_line\":8,\"sources\":[{\"block_id\":\"block-4\",\"source\":{\"end_line\":6,\"kind\":\"line\",\"page\":null,\"part\":null,\"path\":[],\"start_line\":6}},{\"block_id\":\"block-5\",\"source\":{\"end_line\":7,\"kind\":\"line\",\"page\":null,\"part\":null,\"path\":[],\"start_line\":7}}],\"start_char\":48,\"start_line\":6,\"text\":\"## 优惠码\\r\\n提交有效优惠码PROMO5时订单金额减少5元。\\r\\n\\r\\n\"}],\"operation\":\"delete\"},\"index\":0,\"kind\":\"section\",\"new_source_id\":\"parse:872996cb-6707-4691-bb3f-83cd103df439\",\"old_source_id\":\"parse:86a867de-9be8-4389-9233-6d928c7062f8\"},{\"difference\":{\"new\":[{\"end_char\":139,\"heading_block_id\":\"block-6\",\"id\":\"section-4\",\"level\":2,\"parent_id\":\"section-1\",\"start_char\":93,\"title\":\"订单导出\"}],\"new_ranges\":[{\"end_char\":139,\"end_line\":10,\"sources\":[{\"block_id\":\"block-6\",\"source\":{\"end_line\":9,\"kind\":\"line\",\"page\":null,\"part\":null,\"path\":[],\"start_line\":9}},{\"block_id\":\"block-7\",\"source\":{\"end_line\":10,\"kind\":\"line\",\"page\":null,\"part\":null,\"path\":[],\"start_line\":10}}],\"start_char\":93,\"start_line\":9,\"text\":\"## 订单导出\\r\\n新增GET /orders/export，导出订单按创建时间倒序排列。\\r\\n\"}],\"old\":[],\"old_ranges\":[],\"operation\":\"insert\"},\"index\":1,\"kind\":\"section\",\"new_source_id\":\"parse:872996cb-6707-4691-bb3f-83cd103df439\",\"old_source_id\":\"parse:86a867de-9be8-4389-9233-6d928c7062f8\"}],\"analysis_protocol\":{\"instruction\":\"Return one impact-response-v2 JSON object using this response_schema. The saved call owns the current unit; do not output a unit, UUID or hash. Use only short references in fixed_references: S for sources, P for segments, C for cases, D for differences. For action=read supply short references/ranges with no final outcome or candidates; for finish supply unit_outcome/candidates/unresolved with no pending reads. Discovery candidates cite exact supplied original slices; positions are original character offsets, not normalized diff offsets. Case citations use literal JSON paths and actual values from a complete case supplied in this message history. Catalogs are not read evidence. During coordination stage case_impacts, candidates are BoundRuleCaseAssessment objects with rule_ref R1 etc. and case_impacts; assess every fixed rule for the current complete case. The server preserves the fixed rule body and binds identities/hashes before fact checks. Canonical identities mentioned in coordination instructions are internal; this response_schema defines the model reply. Do not rewrite those identities or copy hashes. Request fixed reads for cross-section/missing evidence. Keep intentional negative conditions. Applicability is a suggestion, deployment unknown, all candidates pending review. Do not claim full project coverage or execute/change official records.\",\"response_schema\":{\"$defs\":{\"BoundCaseCandidate\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"case_ref\":{\"pattern\":\"^C[1-9][0-9]*$\",\"title\":\"Case Ref\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"citations\":{\"items\":{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/BoundCaseCitation\"},\"minItems\":1,\"title\":\"Citations\",\"type\":\"array\"},\"level\":{\"enum\":[\"none\",\"minor\",\"major\",\"uncertain\"],\"title\":\"Level\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"reason\":{\"minLength\":1,\"title\":\"Reason\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"verification_points\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"title\":\"Verification Points\",\"type\":\"array\"}},\"required\":[\"case_ref\",\"level\",\"reason\",\"citations\"],\"title\":\"BoundCaseCandidate\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"BoundCaseCitation\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"path\":{\"items\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"type\":\"string\"},{\"type\":\"integer\"}]},\"title\":\"Path\",\"type\":\"array\"},\"root\":{\"default\":\"content_json\",\"enum\":[\"content_json\",\"execution_notes\"],\"title\":\"Root\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"value\":{\"title\":\"Value\"}},\"required\":[\"value\"],\"title\":\"BoundCaseCitation\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"BoundRangeRead\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"end_char\":{\"minimum\":0,\"title\":\"End Char\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"source_ref\":{\"pattern\":\"^S[1-9][0-9]*$\",\"title\":\"Source Ref\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"start_char\":{\"minimum\":0,\"title\":\"Start Char\",\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"source_ref\",\"start_char\",\"end_char\"],\"title\":\"BoundRangeRead\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"BoundReadRequest\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"case_refs\":{\"items\":{\"pattern\":\"^C[1-9][0-9]*$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"maxItems\":100,\"title\":\"Case Refs\",\"type\":\"array\"},\"difference_refs\":{\"items\":{\"pattern\":\"^D[1-9][0-9]*$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"maxItems\":100,\"title\":\"Difference Refs\",\"type\":\"array\"},\"ranges\":{\"items\":{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/BoundRangeRead\"},\"maxItems\":100,\"title\":\"Ranges\",\"type\":\"array\"},\"segment_refs\":{\"items\":{\"pattern\":\"^P[1-9][0-9]*$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"maxItems\":100,\"title\":\"Segment Refs\",\"type\":\"array\"}},\"title\":\"BoundReadRequest\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"BoundRuleCandidate\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"applicability_suggestion\":{\"default\":\"unknown\",\"enum\":[\"unknown\",\"current\",\"future\"],\"title\":\"Applicability Suggestion\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"case_impacts\":{\"items\":{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/BoundCaseCandidate\"},\"title\":\"Case Impacts\",\"type\":\"array\"},\"document_citations\":{\"items\":{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/BoundTextCitation\"},\"minItems\":1,\"title\":\"Document Citations\",\"type\":\"array\"},\"key\":{\"minLength\":1,\"title\":\"Key\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"kind\":{\"enum\":[\"added\",\"modified\",\"removed\",\"uncertain\"],\"title\":\"Kind\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"reason\":{\"minLength\":1,\"title\":\"Reason\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"summary\":{\"minLength\":1,\"title\":\"Summary\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"uncertainties\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"title\":\"Uncertainties\",\"type\":\"array\"}},\"required\":[\"key\",\"kind\",\"summary\",\"reason\",\"document_citations\"],\"title\":\"BoundRuleCandidate\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"BoundRuleCaseAssessment\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"case_impacts\":{\"items\":{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/BoundCaseCandidate\"},\"minItems\":1,\"title\":\"Case Impacts\",\"type\":\"array\"},\"rule_ref\":{\"pattern\":\"^R[1-9][0-9]*$\",\"title\":\"Rule Ref\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"rule_ref\",\"case_impacts\"],\"title\":\"BoundRuleCaseAssessment\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"BoundTextCitation\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"end_char\":{\"minimum\":0,\"title\":\"End Char\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"quote\":{\"minLength\":1,\"title\":\"Quote\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"source_ref\":{\"pattern\":\"^S[1-9][0-9]*$\",\"title\":\"Source Ref\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"start_char\":{\"minimum\":0,\"title\":\"Start Char\",\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"source_ref\",\"start_char\",\"end_char\",\"quote\"],\"title\":\"BoundTextCitation\",\"type\":\"object\"}},\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"action\":{\"enum\":[\"read\",\"finish\"],\"title\":\"Action\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"candidates\":{\"items\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/BoundRuleCandidate\"},{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/BoundRuleCaseAssessment\"}]},\"title\":\"Candidates\",\"type\":\"array\"},\"protocol_version\":{\"const\":\"impact-response-v2\",\"title\":\"Protocol Version\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"reads\":{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/BoundReadRequest\"},\"summary\":{\"minLength\":1,\"title\":\"Summary\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"unit_outcome\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"enum\":[\"analyzed\",\"evidence_insufficient\"],\"type\":\"string\"},{\"type\":\"null\"}],\"default\":null,\"title\":\"Unit Outcome\"},\"unresolved\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"title\":\"Unresolved\",\"type\":\"array\"}},\"required\":[\"protocol_version\",\"action\",\"summary\"],\"title\":\"DocumentImpactBoundDecision\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"scope\":\"one declared unit only\",\"sha256\":\"1153d64ff0fffe0b510e148334e31b5361880c660d67c695b957a57f3bc91e42\",\"version\":\"impact-call-v4\"},\"coordination_context\":{\"discovery_units\":[],\"protocol\":{\"case_instruction\":\"本阶段将rules中完整规则候选与当前完整固定用例及其编写来源比较。逐条返回candidate，key必须为对应rules.id，保留该规则的kind/summary及原文依据，case_impacts仅判断当前unit.id，每条说明none/minor/major/uncertain并引用当前用例实际字段。需要原文或来源时read补读。不得遗漏规则后声明analyzed；无法判断保留evidence_insufficient。discovery_units包含未完成范围时不能宣称完整或无变化。没有规则仍判断本用例来源是否充分。所有候选仍待评审，不能将模型建议当作部署事实或测试通过。\",\"discovery_instruction\":\"本阶段从固定原文及差异提出规则变化候选。只处理当前单元，可read补读。候选引用实际读取的原文；不是需求评审。依据不足保留evidence_insufficient和unresolved。\",\"sha256\":\"76f3c582a070c4b136e1e629ecdea508f0f1fe814e4a8dbd917180ca9051f5b5\",\"version\":\"impact-coordinator-v1\"},\"rules\":[],\"stage\":\"discover_rules\"},\"environment\":{\"deployment_status\":\"unknown\",\"environment_key\":\"声明环境\",\"provenance\":\"user_declared\",\"target_release\":\"尚无部署证据\"},\"fixed_case_catalog\":[{\"case_id\":\"35e8816c-804b-4020-ab29-03006e15a832\",\"content_hash\":\"530020d9041d3a8a3ae24d85914efa404bee888c064e2be1455d80055bd417ff\",\"version_id\":\"e14d5080-ff2e-425b-8e21-5129eb092ea9\",\"version_record_sha256\":\"c4e3ce8b277528a0cb0a2cd578f81d4be72a3c3d0dd8c2f59537db35dc9a1ce0\"},{\"case_id\":\"7f949c69-1dc7-4b98-972d-2d3af1299354\",\"content_hash\":\"bceebec74fd2ec247242114e2a963ffb9ed90759e82197cf7a9e8be0ddd5e87d\",\"version_id\":\"fdc2ca2b-a91f-4022-b7fe-30cb26cadb12\",\"version_record_sha256\":\"a4927870b17bff5930bc342d3ffd857cefc187571297613b5b65e11583cd5f09\"},{\"case_id\":\"ca188f9a-63b4-4d91-be12-4b14d432f950\",\"content_hash\":\"e3b1c996b90ce6ea9855249ad3d1d36d4eda074517dc1fa0786b5fe1e642bffd\",\"version_id\":\"18d304e8-da31-45df-aa74-344bb67e1bd8\",\"version_record_sha256\":\"e78216f888bd752091d9a9f46b7e98ac1995a589de5a85a929a1fcad0ca57032\"}],\"fixed_difference_catalog\":[{\"id\":\"raw:0\",\"index\":0,\"kind\":\"raw\",\"sha256\":\"da384bfb28bde318cfa27